  "scope": {
    "session_reused": true,
    "disclosure": "Same session/reviewer as bf9; prior verdict and previously viewed bf9 pixels remain in context. Earlier unrelated village/source-fixture tasks also occurred in this session. This is an independent successor pixels review, not a fresh-context reviewer. No Fight-camera production source, diff, solver, numerical producer verdict, or author self-report consulted for this review.",
    "judge_inputs": "Only 54 named successor original PNGs, user-provided pair/milestone bindings and requested criteria, plus five restored reference images. Archive report files were hashed for preservation, not read as successor judging input.",
    "criteria": "Exact user-provided F21#4: Fight camera keeps both actors framed without overlap for small, normal and giant bodies (catalog P2-062/P2-092 class); code-blind judge PASS on a size matrix. Additional requested whole-creature/head/feet/antler/tail visibility relative to HUD/foreground and owner FULL Palworld/Animo creature/world plus Valheim light/atmosphere craft bar.",
    "method": "Opened every original individually using view_image detail=original. No cropping, recolouring, transformed sheets or montage substitutes. Ten originals revisited for contacts. Pixel observations are qualitative, not solver measurements.",
    "limits": [
      "Still images only: no performance, motion smoothness, frame rate, device, earned-path, physical-movement execution, Quick execution or co-op claim.",
      "Native capture provenance is supplied by the user; pixels and immutable bytes were inspected, no engine execution independently performed.",
      "Pose self-occlusion (rear-on face, far-side limbs/tail) is disclosed and not automatically a framing failure. Small grass strands or unproven minute contacts are not invented failures. Clear foreground cover and inadequate distant detail are failures.",
      "No producer numerical PASS was opened or used. Review counts are reviewer-derived observations, not producer metrics.",
      "Five appropriate restored boards viewed; no separate literal Animo/Valheim screenshot comparison was available among those selected boards. Their requested direction was assessed using owner boards and meadow/Palworld references, not claimed as exhaustive benchmark equivalence.",
      "No source, engine, import, render, export, GPU, tests, Git, tracked writes, board acceptance edits, spawned sessions or external messages. Only three requested ignored output files written.",
      "No literal acceptance, packaging, canonical authority or implementation-cause claim. ROOT assesses these independently."
    ],
    "archive_policy": "Successor review does not replace or revise bf9 archived seven-pair camera FAIL/all-nine craft FAIL. Both existing archived report files' before/after SHA256 match exactly; original bf9 captures and all previous artifacts were untouched."
  },
